{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"uk-student-loan UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"uk-student-loan.copy.howAnswer","keys":["uk-student-loan.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Pilih satu rencana pendapatan-kondisional UK, masukkan satu jumlah pendapatan tahunan, tahun pembayaran pertama dan tanggal pembayaran pinjaman pertama Anda. Jalankan estimator lagi untuk rencana pinjaman yang berbeda. Perkiraan menggunakan ambang batas dan tingkat ZXQPH0000QXZ–ZXQPH0001QXZ resmi.","record_id":"e125b8a08817d1218875711f6f515b9485dc615f919f24e36573a749119a699e","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.171428844875095,"source":"Choose one UK income-contingent plan, enter one annual income amount, the first repayment year and the date of your first loan payment. Run the estimator again for a different loan plan. The estimate uses official 2026–27 thresholds and rates.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"9f528db83c3948479ca8b2794fc32ca1be99b2d7248618e9f00947db510f0bbc","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Pilih satu rencana pendapatan-kondisional UK, masukkan satu jumlah pendapatan tahunan, tahun pembayaran pertama dan tanggal pembayaran pinjaman pertama Anda. Jalankan estimator lagi untuk rencana pinjaman yang berbeda. Perkiraan menggunakan ambang batas dan tingkat 2026–27 resmi.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Divide advertising costs by the number of impressions, then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 on top of 1,000 impressions gives a CPM of $10. The currency is whatever you use to spend.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"cpm-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Bagikan biaya iklan dengan jumlah impresi, lalu kalikan dengan ZXQPH0000QXZ. Sebagai contoh, $ZXQPH0001QXZ di atas impresi ZXQPH0002QXZ memberikan CPM sebesar $ZXQPH0003QXZ. Mata uangnya adalah apapun yang Anda gunakan untuk menghabiskan.","record_id":"e111b418a676df28fdb54369bebf0abba330dbae167fa625a62e5f0fe3de5326","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":3.0523898746249998,"source":"Divide the ad spend by the number of impressions, then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 over 1,000 impressions gives a CPM of $10. The currency is whatever you used for spend.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"c14434161a5361c1ae7b3ae1ac78be90ef1a6cb394b485d83f55558fad116f25","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Bagikan biaya iklan dengan jumlah impresi, lalu kalikan dengan 1,000. Sebagai contoh, $10 di atas impresi 1,000 memberikan CPM sebesar $10. Mata uangnya adalah apapun yang Anda gunakan untuk menghabiskan.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
